# ==============================================================================
# High-Value Interbank Wire Settlement Gateway - REST Client Scenarios
# ==============================================================================
# Standards: VS Code REST Client (Humao.rest-client)
# Organized in self-contained, repeatable workflows with variable chaining.
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiPrefix = /api/v1
@bankUrl = http://localhost:8010

# ==============================================================================
# 0. SYSTEM HEALTH & READINESS PROBES
# ==============================================================================

###
# 0.1 Ingestion Gateway Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###
# 0.2 Ingestion Gateway Readiness Probe (Database Connectivity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

###
# 0.3 Wholesale Bank Simulator Liveness Probe
GET {{bankUrl}}/health

###
# 0.4 Wholesale Bank Simulator Readiness Probe
GET {{bankUrl}}/ready


# ==============================================================================
# 1. HAPPY PATH INGESTION & IN-FLIGHT QUERY WORKFLOW
# ==============================================================================

###
# 1.1 Ingest Wholesale Wire Transfer ($2,500,000.00 USD)
# @name ingestWireHappyPath
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idem-treasury-2026-alpha-001
X-Request-ID: req-client-treasury-001

{
  "client_id": "CORP-TREASURY-001",
  "amount": "2500000.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "beneficiary_account": "9876543210",
  "routing_number": "121000358",
  "swift_bic": "CHASUS33XXX"
}

###
# 1.2 Inspect In-Flight Processing State (FinTech Anti-Blackhole Guarantee)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires/{{ingestWireHappyPath.response.body.wire_id}}
X-Request-ID: req-client-query-001

###
# 1.3 Query Bank Clearinghouse Settlement State (Two-Phase Inquiry)
GET {{bankUrl}}/v1/wires/idem-treasury-2026-alpha-001

###
# 1.4 List Ingested Wires for Client
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires?client_id=CORP-TREASURY-001&limit=10


# ==============================================================================
# 2. ATOMIC IDEMPOTENCY RE-SUBMISSION WORKFLOW
# ==============================================================================

###
# 2.1 Re-Submit Identical Wire with Same Idempotency Key (Safe Replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idem-treasury-2026-alpha-001

{
  "client_id": "CORP-TREASURY-001",
  "amount": "2500000.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "beneficiary_account": "9876543210",
  "routing_number": "121000358",
  "swift_bic": "CHASUS33XXX"
}


# ==============================================================================
# 3. AUTO-GENERATED IDEMPOTENCY WORKFLOW
# ==============================================================================

###
# 3.1 Ingest Wire with Omitted Idempotency-Key Header
# @name ingestAutoIdemWire
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "GLOBAL-INVEST-CORP",
  "amount": "750000.50",
  "currency": "USD",
  "beneficiary_account": "1122334455",
  "routing_number": "021000021",
  "swift_bic": "BKTRUS33XXX"
}

###
# 3.2 Inspect Auto-Generated Wire Status
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires/{{ingestAutoIdemWire.response.body.wire_id}}


# ==============================================================================
# 4. VALIDATION & FINANCIAL EDGE CASES
# ==============================================================================

###
# 4.1 Reject Invalid ABA Routing Number (Must be exactly 9 digits)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "CORP-TREASURY-001",
  "amount": "10000.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "beneficiary_account": "12345678",
  "routing_number": "1234",
  "swift_bic": "CHASUS33XXX"
}

###
# 4.2 Reject Invalid Zero or Negative Amount
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "CORP-TREASURY-001",
  "amount": "-500.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "beneficiary_account": "12345678",
  "routing_number": "121000358",
  "swift_bic": "CHASUS33XXX"
}

###
# 4.3 Query Non-Existent Wire UUID (Expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wires/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
